%U A030242 66596433872563489681044225962,46555991186303652709661673105412264,120167473883026175772012211899430158525522
%N A030242 Number of n-point nonisomorphic relations with no symmetry.
%H A030242 Vladeta Jovovic, <a href="/A030242/a030242.pdf">Asymmetric Binary Relations — Extension of OEIS A030242</a>
%F A030242 a(n) = (1/n!)*Sum_{H <= S_n} mu(1,H)*2^orb_2(H), where the sum is over all subgroups H of S_n, mu is the Moebius function of the subgroup lattice, and orb_2(H) is the number of H-orbits on [n] X [n] under the diagonal action h:(i,j) -> (h(i),h(j)). - _Vladeta Jovovic_, Aug 27 2026
%K A030242 nonn,more,changed
